      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>A special value for the line breaking word style option.</para>
          <para>The auto option for the line break word style does some heuristics based on locales and line count.</para>
          <para>If a locale list contains Korean script, this option uses <see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakWordStyle.Phrase" />. If it contains Japanese script but not Korean script, the line breaker can try phrase-based breaks when its first result has fewer than five lines. It keeps the phrase-based result only if that result also has fewer than five lines. Otherwise, it uses <see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakWordStyle.None" />.</para>
          <para>Note: future versions may have special line breaking word style rules for other locales.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/text/LineBreakConfig#LINE_BREAK_WORD_STYLE_AUTO" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.text.LineBreakConfig.LINE_BREAK_WORD_STYLE_AUTO</code>.</a></format></para>
          <para>Portions of this page are modifications based on work created and shared by the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/site-policies" title="Android Open Source Project">Android Open Source Project</a></format> and used according to terms described in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5/" title="Creative Commons 2.5 Attribution License">Creative Commons 2.5 Attribution License.</a></format></para>
        </summary>
      </Docs>
    </Member>
